  "published": "2026-07-24T15:51:48.873Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.5.12 - Bug-fix release; same engine fixes as Cocos2D-Mono 2.5.12 (action copy constructors, CCCallFuncN.InitWithTarget, CCMenuItemSprite null image, CCTextFieldTTF auto-edit, CCRawList RemoveRange corruption + buffer leak), without the MonoGame.Content.Builder.Task dependency.\n2.5.11 - Debut of Cocos2D-Mono.Core, the content-pipeline-free variant replacing the per-platform Cocos2D-Mono.Core.{DesktopGL,Windows,Linux,macOS,Android,iOS} packages (2.5.10 was their final release). Same runtime as Cocos2D-Mono, without the MonoGame.Content.Builder.Task dependency.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
